          "text": "Listen, you don't happen to know Pynya, do you? He was about your height too, a timid little runt. Used to come round to your base all the time, and one day he got smart, walks in and says: 'Drinks on the house for everyone!' Ah, poor Pynya. Don't end up like him — turn out your pockets!",
